{"id":"206810","name":"韩国泡菜","author":"大大大吃货丶","authorId":"8363064","desc":"","cover":"https://i3.meishichina.com/atta/recipe/2015/01/24/20150124223233527.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p800","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大白菜","amount":"1棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"10勺"},{"name":"辣酱粉","amount":"50克"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"苹果","amount":"1/2个"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"5勺"},{"name":"韩国辣酱","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"10段"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"两勺辣酱（根据个人口味，喜欢辣的可以多加点）","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223235797.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"所有切好的佐料。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223239682.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"全部抹好盐放在一旁，腌10个小时左右。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223244599.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"这是腌好的白菜，会出很多水，要倒掉，再冲一遍水，放在一旁备用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223248282.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"根据白菜的多少来决定糯米粉的量。放在锅里加凉水搅拌均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223255218.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"一边加热（小火或中火，大火会烤焦）一边搅拌，到糯米粉熟透（透明状）","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223301799.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"将半个苹果和洋葱切丁，韭菜、白萝卜和红萝卜切丝。有条件的话可以用搅拌机搅成浆。不过我更喜欢切，因为更像韩国电视里面那样。材料就准备就绪了。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223308996.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"这时候火可以关掉了，利用灶上的余热就可以了。加入辣椒粉。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223314145.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"两勺辣酱（根据个人口味，喜欢辣的可以多加点）","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223321144.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"所有切好的佐料。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223328430.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀，拌的时候可以用力挤压，让各种佐料的汁融入酱料里。就是要涂在大白菜上的成品。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223335790.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"一层一层的抹上酱料。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223342603.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"拿可以密封的盒子来装。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223349260.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":14,"desc":"-5片白菜就可以装一盒了。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223356718.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入冰箱冷冻柜，腌上2-3天就可以拿出来吃啦。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2015/01/24/p800_20150124223402520.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"素菜最好是打成浆加入，会比较好操作。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}